    <sectiondef kind="user-defined">
      <header>Deprecated Type Wrappers</header>
      <description><para>The v5.0.1 names of the <computeroutput>to_*</computeroutput> type wrappers.</para>
<para>The Boost UT style names, with a leading underscore, kept for compatibility with the existing applications. Each one is an alias of the corresponding <computeroutput>to_*</computeroutput> wrapper, so the wrapped values are compared and reported in the same way. They do not conflict with the literal operators with the same suffixes (<computeroutput>42<ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-deprecated-literals_1ga8468610e763177a8f569f7d618851288" kindref="member">_i</ref></computeroutput>), which are in the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1literals" kindref="compound">literals</ref></computeroutput> namespace.</para>
<para>GCC reports the deprecation only when the alias names the type of a declaration, not when it is used in an expression, as in <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-deprecated-literals_1ga8468610e763177a8f569f7d618851288" kindref="member">_i</ref> (expr)</computeroutput>; Clang reports it in both cases.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Deprecated</title><para>Pass the plain values to the function comparators <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1gaa7c7b6a7ad32856edc235a05e77d8c7f" kindref="member">eq()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1ga5bf176ef730172592095657417e5f039" kindref="member">ne()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1ga9ae8e4747ff029faa7378110c8680278" kindref="member">gt()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1gab8da4228bc9a820546753b018a129a7e" kindref="member">ge()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1ga714ff07cd77e05898de4fd315770f901" kindref="member">lt()</ref></computeroutput>, and <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1gae695dd46840f76a156aee70ff4df33fa" kindref="member">le()</ref></computeroutput> instead; the <computeroutput>to_*</computeroutput> type wrappers that replaced these aliases (since 3.2.0) are deprecated too (since 6.0.0). </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</description>
