          <briefdescription>
          </briefdescription>
          <detaileddescription>
<para>Displays only the failed checks and the overall session summary; the TAP reporter also displays one result line per test suite, counted by the plan, and the failed checks as comments. </para>
          </detaileddescription>
        </enumvalue>
        <enumvalue id="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1a809871d76f29309ed9c6fbd96d5a914bafea087517c26fadd409bd4b9dc642555" prot="public">
